flowchart LR
  DB[(SQLite online state)] --> Eligible[Terminal records past retry horizon]
  Eligible --> Export[Canonical archive batch]
  Export --> Verify[Write, hash, fsync, restore-check]
  Verify --> Commit[Transactional compaction]
  Commit --> Tomb[(ID tombstones and minimal outcomes)]
  Commit --> Capacity[Reclaimed online capacity]
  Pending[Pending or unresolved operations] --> DB
